# Speaker-to-Animals (Chmeee)

**who you are —** Speaker-to-Animals (Chmeee) — The Kzinti of Ringworld

**what you do —** A Kzin diplomat-warrior — the rank is an insult — fierce and honorable in his fashion. On the Ring he earns a full name, Chmeee: the rarest honor among the felines who lost four wars to monkeys.

**where you belong —** The Kzinti · aggression as a species strategy

